    - orphan temp swept (temps are never referenced / never in a backup snapshot)
    - aged file-only final (ff/ffff..., 3 days old > 48h) deleted; bucket left empty
    - record-only eeee... (file already gone): settled, NOT re-mutated, no crash
      (this is the path the abandoned version crashed on: it attempted
      mark_purged, which the FND-03 trg_blob_objects_finalize_guard trigger
      rejects - finalized rows are terminal in the DB)
    - missing-referenced incident (a1b2c3d4...) NOT deleted - counted only
    Note: a first gc attempt on the abandoned code crashed here with
    "finalized blob objects may only be purged, never re-staged" after having
    swept the temp; the repair removed the row mutation (see learnings item 7).

