## Verification-fix regression smoke (2026-09-20, post-2bb96eb, V1-V6)

Fixes under test (defects found by manual review of 2bb96eb):
- DEFECT 1: GC swept every listed temp immediately - a temp of an in-flight
  put (visible while writing/validating) could be unlinked from under it.
  Fix: list_temporaries() now returns TemporaryStats (relative_path + mtime);
  the finding carries the temp's mtime as its age anchor; GC sweeps a temp
  only after the SAME safety delay (one coherent policy) has elapsed since
  the temp's last write. A live put keeps its temp's mtime fresh, so a fresh
  temp can never be swept.
- DEFECT 2: _finalize() fsynced the tmp dir BEFORE put()'s finally ran
  temp.unlink() (the docstring falsely claimed "after the unlink"), and a
  newly created objects/<prefix> bucket was fsynced without its parent
  objects/, so the bucket's own directory entry could be lost on crash while
  the DB row already points at it.
  Fix: temp-dir fsync moved to put()'s finally AFTER temp.unlink(); _finalize
  fsyncs objects/ when the bucket was newly created; docstring now matches
  the real ordering.

V1: plant fresh temp blobs/tmp/cccc0000-3333-4444-5555-666677778888.tmp (49 B, mtime = now)

